# DR-06: an allowlist. Nothing enters the image's build context but what the build and the notices need, so no .env
# file, .git, the developer's bin/syft.exe, the tests, the documents or .claude/ can reach a layer. .editorconfig is
# in: the build's style checks read it.
*
!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!.editorconfig
!src/
!LICENSE
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!licenses/

# Build output, and any .env file, even inside an allowed folder (U6-NFR-05).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.env*
